graph TB
    Candidate((Candidate))
    Recruiter((Recruiter))
    AI((System AI))

    subgraph Platform [AI Recruitment Platform]
        direction TB
        UC1(Take Voice Interview)
        UC2(View Profile)
        UC3(Create Scenarios)
        UC5(Analytics Dashboard)
        
        UC6(Transcribe Audio)
        UC7(Analyze Responses)
        UC8(Generate Insights)
    end

    Candidate --> UC1
    Candidate --> UC2
    
    Recruiter --> UC3
    Recruiter --> UC5
    
    UC1 -.->|Voice| AI
    UC7 -.->|LLM| AI
    
    UC1 --> UC6
    UC6 --> UC7
    UC7 --> UC8
    UC8 --> UC5
